You are a Senior React Native UI/UX Engineer and Mobile Application Architect.

Build a production-ready React Native (Expo + TypeScript) application.

Do NOT create a demo application.

This application will be used by registration staff and volunteers during the APTICON Conference.

The application should be extremely fast, simple, and optimized for event operations.

Staff members should be able to process attendees in just a few seconds.

